            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo invia la risposta HTTP al frontend?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.append()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res.send()</code>.</p></body></html>",
